ar}[X] \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\text{Var}[X].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can compute the variance of $X$ using the following formula:\n\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2}\n$$\n\nAdditionally, we're given that $\\text{E}[X]=0.$ \n\nWe start by computing $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$ Summing up the products of each value of ${X}^{2}$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & =(-1)^{2}\\cdot f(-1)+{0}^{2}\\cdot f(0)+{1}^{2}\\cdot f(1) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}-{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[\\sqrt{5}X+4] & =5\\cdot \\text{Var}[X] \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\frac{2}{5} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535835 true] [17592186369022 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369023 13194139535835 true] [17592186369022 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369024 13194139535835 true] [17592186369022 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369025 13194139535835 true] [17592186369022 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369026 13194139535835 true] [17592186369022 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369027 13194139535835 true] [17592186369022 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535835 true] [17592186369022 1041 "selection" 13194139535835 true] [17592186369022 1104 #edb/ref 17592186369025 13194139535835 true] [17592186369022 1110 #uuid "e4c7f961-8bd0-5161-8904-d148e0c79084" 13194139535835 true] [17592186369023 1034 "\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}+4" 13194139535835 true] [17592186369023 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535835 true] [17592186369023 1111 #uuid "56d3a88c-7ad8-57fd-9c72-7b52d059228f" 13194139535835 true] [17592186369024 1034 "\\frac{2\\sqrt{5}}{5}" 13194139535835 true] [17592186369024 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535835 true] [17592186369024 1111 #uuid "a3bb1365-7088-5b65-86dd-73e3bcd87292" 13194139535835 true] [17592186369025 1034 "2" 13194139535835 true] [17592186369025 1103 #e